                "Sir Pherozeshah Mehta (1845–1915): 'Lion of Bombay' (Bombay no Sinh); brilliant barrister; dominated the Bombay Municipal Corporation (Father of Bombay Municipality) and the Bombay Presidency Association; INC President in 1890 (Calcutta); uncompromising believer in constitutionalism.",
